WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.425
Let’s walk through Alliance Tracking.

00:00:02.425 --> 00:00:05.963
Separate signals, intentions, and confirmed commitments.

00:00:05.963 --> 00:00:08.613
Record who is aligned, what the alignment concerns,

00:00:08.613 --> 00:00:12.200
when it changed, and what evidence supports that interpretation

00:00:12.200 --> 00:00:12.338
.

00:00:12.338 --> 00:00:16.175
On this slide, record coalition signals, external relationships

00:00:16.175 --> 00:00:18.663
, commitments, and changes in alignment.

00:00:18.663 --> 00:00:22.038
In practice, separate an expressed intention from a confirmed

00:00:22.038 --> 00:00:25.163
agreement, and identify the move in which the relationship

00:00:25.163 --> 00:00:26.087
changed.

00:00:26.585 --> 00:00:29.610
When you are ready, use Open Alliance Tracking to

00:00:29.610 --> 00:00:31.398
move to the live surface.

00:00:31.398 --> 00:00:34.110
The guide will not make the workflow decision for you

00:00:34.110 --> 00:00:34.260
.
